<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian foreign exchange market shut on Monday.</title>
<headline>Indonesian foreign exchange market shut on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indonesian foreign exchange market was closed on Monday for the Eid al-Fitr Moslem holiday.</p>
<p>Spot rupiah was last traded on Friday at 2,378.25 at 0800 GMT, against an opening of 2,377.0/78.0.</p>
<p>The foreign exchange market reopens on February 12.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
